        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ntam pui ting mik pat pu the",
            "Dupkan the muang ding khou neimik tei;",
            "Thaoruai mun bang nchung ngam the,",
            "Bamdu tho kaam thao kan ni the.",
            "",
            "Asei bam cham nthuan ntam ,",
            "Lung ni mak ge hei kandi khou;",
            "Ravguangc zankhou zaeng su cham kho.",
            "",
            "2. Ntam pui ban ham guang mei hei",
            "Amu mak na tingmik thui ning e;",
            "Tat kan ni the zian mei nun le.",
            "Zausuak lou na ro aphai kam.",
            "",
            "3. Tingzin kei kan nimei nei mik.",
            "Ai ruina zyang rina zau puki",
            "Kei kan the alung le nei tei,",
            "Zian mei bam mei luang but rukhou.",
            "",
            "4. Thing nuang panuh munpuangc gaimei",
            "Nthu luanh zian mei lung siimei khuanc",
            "Kandih khou gaimei hou ngam the.",
            "Neihla mei nzian mei ham na."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
